	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/markdown" rect="(436.0, -154.0, 369.0, 117.0)" font-family="Segoe UI" font-size="16">A ***workflow*** is made up of **widgets* (*the computational units*) and links (the connection between widgets enabling the *flow of information*): it starts from the top-left hand corner and enrolls left-ro-right and top-to bottom</text>
		<text id="1" type="text/markdown" rect="(65.0, -148.0, 154.0, 63.0)" font-family="Segoe UI" font-size="16">**Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)**</text>
		<arrow id="2" start="(943.0, 220.0)" end="(891.0, 222.0)" fill="#C1272D" />
		<text id="3" type="text/plain" rect="(953.0, 187.0, 262.0, 57.0)" font-family="Segoe UI" font-size="16">the 3 outgoing flows from the filter do create the 3 different groups</text>
	</annotations>
